---
const media = '/films/skyhook-introduction';
---
<section class="introduction-film" id="watch" aria-labelledby="film-title" data-introduction-film>
  <div class="film-heading">
    <div><p class="section-index">A FIRST LOOK / ORIGINAL FILM</p><h2 id="film-title">One handoff.<br />A different way up.</h2></div>
    <p>Follow a payload from approach to release, then see how one tether could become part of a wider network.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="film-player" data-film-player>
    <button class="film-poster" type="button" data-film-play aria-label="Watch how a skyhook works — 90 seconds, with narration and captions">
      <img src={`${media}-poster.webp`} width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="A rotating orbital tether carries a payload above Earth's curved horizon." />
      <span class="film-play-label"><span class="film-play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span><span>Watch how a skyhook works<small>90 seconds · Narrated · Captioned</small></span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="film-foot"><p>Concept illustration, followed by Flight Studio and Expeditions.</p><a href="/system/#flight-story-title">Explore each moment ↗</a></div>
  <details class="film-transcript"><summary>Read the transcript</summary><div>
    <p>Reaching orbit takes speed as well as height. What if some of the machinery that gives a payload that speed could stay in space?</p>
    <p>A skyhook is a rotating tether in orbit. Near the bottom of its swing, its tip moves against the orbital motion, reducing the speed an approaching payload needs to match.</p>
    <p>A launch vehicle climbs to the meeting point. Position, speed and timing must align. A grapple secures the payload, and the tether carries the load.</p>
    <p>As the tether turns, the payload gains orbital energy. At a chosen release point, it leaves on its own trajectory.</p>
    <p>That energy comes from the tether's motion. Before the next handoff, the system must recover. Propulsion, or carefully planned returning cargo, could help restore what the outgoing payload took.</p>
    <p>One tether could become part of a transport network: a lunar lunavator, an anchor at Phobos, and routes further into the solar system.</p>
    <p>Skyhook Industries explores that possibility. Design and test a flight in Flight Studio. Build and supply a network in Expeditions.</p>
    <p>Start with one handoff. See where it could lead.</p>
    <p class="film-description">The illustration follows an Earth tether, zooms into a conceptual grapple, and shows release and recovery. Free-orbiting Earth and lunar tethers connect to a Phobos-anchored system. The final shots show the site's actual flight experiment and strategy game.</p>
  </div></details>
  <noscript><p class="film-nojs"><a href={`${media}.mp4`}>Open the introduction film</a> · <a href={`${media}.vtt`}>Download captions</a>. The transcript is available above.</p></noscript>
</section>
<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-introduction-film]').forEach(section => {
    const trigger = section.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-film-play]');
    const player = section.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-film-player]');
    trigger?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!player) return;
      const video = document.createElement('video');
      video.controls = true;
      video.playsInline = true;
      video.preload = 'metadata';
      video.poster = '/films/skyhook-introduction-poster.webp';
      video.setAttribute('aria-label', 'How a skyhook works: an original narrated introduction');
      video.setAttribute('tabindex', '0');
      const source = document.createElement('source');
      source.src = '/films/skyhook-introduction.mp4'; source.type = 'video/mp4';
      const captions = document.createElement('track');
      captions.kind = 'captions'; captions.srclang = 'en'; captions.label = 'English';
      captions.src = '/films/skyhook-introduction.vtt'; captions.default = true;
      const failure = () => {
        if (player.querySelector('[data-film-error]')) return;
        const message = document.createElement('p');
        message.dataset.filmError = '';
        message.setAttribute('role', 'status');
        message.append('Playback is unavailable here. ');
        const link = document.createElement('a');
        link.href = source.src; link.textContent = 'Open the film directly';
        message.append(link, ', or read the transcript below.');
        player.append(message);
      };
      source.addEventListener('error', failure);
      video.addEventListener('error', failure);
      video.append(source, captions);
      player.replaceChildren(video);
      video.focus({ preventScroll: true });
      // A deliberate play request is also appropriate with reduced motion.
      // Native controls preserve pause, captions, volume, seeking and fullscreen.
      void video.play().catch(() => { /* Native play remains available. */ });
    }, { once: true });
  });
</script>
<style>
  .introduction-film{max-width:1320px;margin:auto;padding:76px 40px 62px;border-top:1px solid #344149;color:#e9edef}
  .film-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin-bottom:30px}.film-heading h2{margin:14px 0 0;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:1.1}.film-heading>p{max-width:36ch;color:#b6c0c6;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;margin:0}
  .film-player{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#0a1116;border:1px solid #435159;overflow:hidden}.film-poster{position:relative;display:block;width:100%;height:100%;padding:0;border:0;background:#0a1116;cursor:pointer;color:#f0f3f4;text-align:left}.film-poster img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.film-play-label{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px;padding:60px 30px 26px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(5,10,14,.94));font:500 clamp(15px,2vw,23px)/1.35 var(--sans)}.film-play-label small{display:block;margin-top:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:#c0ced4;letter-spacing:.04em}.film-play-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;width:54px;height:54px;padding-left:3px;border-radius:50%;background:#e9a078;color:#11191e;font-size:18px}.film-poster:hover .film-play-icon{background:#ffd1b4}.film-poster:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #f5b48d;outline-offset:-5px}.film-player :global(video){display:block;width:100%;height:100%;background:#0a1116}.film-player :global(video:focus-visible){outline:3px solid #f5b48d;outline-offset:-3px}.film-player :global([data-film-error]){position:absolute;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:42px;margin:0;padding:14px;background:#101b23;color:#edf1f3;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.film-player :global([data-film-error] a){color:#efaf87}
  .film-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 0;color:#a9b6be;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.film-foot p{margin:0}.film-foot a,.film-nojs a{color:#efaf87;text-underline-offset:4px}.film-transcript{border-top:1px solid #344149;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#c2ccd1}.film-transcript summary{padding:16px 0;cursor:pointer;min-height:48px}.film-transcript summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #f5b48d;outline-offset:4px}.film-transcript>div{max-width:78ch;padding-bottom:15px}.film-transcript p{margin:0 0 16px}.film-description{font-size:12px;color:#a9b6be}.film-nojs{font-size:14px}
  @media(max-width:700px){.introduction-film{padding:44px 22px 36px}.film-heading{display:block}.film-heading>p{margin-top:20px;font-size:15px}.film-play-label{padding:38px 13px 13px;gap:11px}.film-play-icon{width:38px;height:38px;font-size:14px}.film-play-label small{font-size:10px}.film-foot{display:block}.film-foot a{display:inline-block;margin-top:7px}}
</style>
